  "question": {
    "text": "<p>For <math> <mrow> <mtext>a</mtext> <mo>&#8712;</mo> <mtext>R</mtext> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;(the set of all real numbers), <math> <mrow> <mtext>a</mtext> <mo>&#8800;</mo> <mo>-</mo> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> </math>, <math> <mrow> <munder> <mtext>lim</mtext> <mrow> <mtext>n</mtext> <mo>&#8594;</mo> <mo>&#8734;</mo> </mrow> </munder> <mfrac> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <msup> <mn>1</mn> <mtext>a</mtext> </msup> <mo>+</mo> <msup> <mn>2</mn> <mtext>a</mtext> </msup> <mo>+</mo> <mo>&#8230;</mo> <mo>+</mo> <msup> <mtext>n</mtext> <mtext>a</mtext> </msup> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> <mrow> <msup> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>n</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> <mrow> <mtext>a</mtext> <mo>-</mo> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> </msup> <mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>na</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>+</mo> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>na</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>+</mo> <mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>na</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <mtext>n</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>6</mn> <mn>0</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;Then a =</p>",
